{"versions":[{"path":"versions/ffeff502-ba40-40cc-9513-d97afd18f583/986d2339e60022f3298739ce07714c7b113e1025b27f059c1e52ee7091778b16.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"ffeff502-ba40-40cc-9513-d97afd18f583","revision":"sha256:986d2339e60022f3298739ce07714c7b113e1025b27f059c1e52ee7091778b16","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"导致 COPD 的最主要危险因素是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"空气污染","correct":false,"option_id":"22606af9-963b-410f-bf0b-924f25107197"},{"type":"text","content":"吸烟","correct":true,"option_id":"b8d27ce1-fd80-4a9e-9693-7538f3f3ab09"},{"type":"text","content":"职业粉尘","correct":false,"option_id":"4af692e7-9b0a-4838-866f-e8e82e1c64ca"},{"type":"text","content":"反复呼吸道感染","correct":false,"option_id":"b69ba9e4-4e8f-486f-a6c5-180fdb39468b"},{"type":"text","content":"α₁-抗胰蛋白酶缺乏","correct":false,"option_id":"93126b78-c002-4800-965a-5625fcd85752"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"吸烟是COPD的重要危险因素, 在本题选项中为主要危险因素; 不吸烟者也可因空气污染、职业暴露或遗传因素等患病。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/6f04c06b-3a01-42bb-b087-cfd9583887d8/70366dcaf95ad764e93cbb91465b1fbcbd5ae9c16f8ae06a7634c1d2dd52824f.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"6f04c06b-3a01-42bb-b087-cfd9583887d8","revision":"sha256:70366dcaf95ad764e93cbb91465b1fbcbd5ae9c16f8ae06a7634c1d2dd52824f","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"与小气道纤维化狭窄, 肺实质破坏共同导致 COPD 气流受限的核心机制不包括:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"气道慢性炎症(中性粒细胞, 巨噬细胞, CD8⁺ T 细胞)","correct":false,"option_id":"cb6e3876-9cad-4b4c-9f4d-86758e7bc2f1"},{"type":"text","content":"氧化应激","correct":false,"option_id":"8b3eb4e6-adaa-4e78-9657-6dc6be41532c"},{"type":"text","content":"蛋白酶/抗蛋白酶失衡","correct":false,"option_id":"b8071012-da97-42ef-a5f1-d928d66dbb2e"},{"type":"text","content":"黏液高分泌","correct":false,"option_id":"8f713f32-043c-4891-b6c3-478d7b1d3a40"},{"type":"text","content":"气道平滑肌细胞 IgE 介导的速发型超敏反应","correct":true,"option_id":"c095f429-f896-4751-bca3-9db5a6ba7356"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"COPD气流受限与小气道病变、肺实质破坏及慢性炎症等有关; E所述IgE介导的速发型超敏反应并非其典型核心机制。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/e7d6121f-b5e1-4b21-8561-91b12b30001c/04fb49ea86d52e9c72672240047c2afe692a4d6d81d62552a3e5c043941d0181.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"e7d6121f-b5e1-4b21-8561-91b12b30001c","revision":"sha256:04fb49ea86d52e9c72672240047c2afe692a4d6d81d62552a3e5c043941d0181","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"肺气肿的病理学定义是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"终末细支气管远端气腔持久异常扩大伴肺泡壁破坏, 无明显纤维化","correct":true,"option_id":"1f003c76-60aa-4185-978d-4588184d3733"},{"type":"text","content":"气道黏膜下黏液腺增生, 浆液腺黏液化","correct":false,"option_id":"6b928baa-5b30-4e05-84ce-82e3e9c6ef2d"},{"type":"text","content":"肺泡间隔增厚伴淋巴细胞浸润","correct":false,"option_id":"b4987e71-f217-472b-8eec-fe4c685cb33b"},{"type":"text","content":"肺实质纤维瘢痕形成","correct":false,"option_id":"70bec9c5-32ad-4d5f-a4d7-29a25060876a"},{"type":"text","content":"支气管壁软骨破坏","correct":false,"option_id":"8c4207d5-2870-424d-8640-89e54ddde078"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"肺气肿是终末细支气管远端气腔异常持久扩大, 伴肺泡壁破坏且无明显纤维化。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/bc5b6819-f877-40a8-8135-d72ff3c5b328/9491bf2d84886d284e4d3a0c8dddbe0edc268b05c654ae1dd0c6862afa713f32.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"bc5b6819-f877-40a8-8135-d72ff3c5b328","revision":"sha256:9491bf2d84886d284e4d3a0c8dddbe0edc268b05c654ae1dd0c6862afa713f32","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"\"咳嗽, 咳痰每年≥3个月, 连续≥2年, 并排除其他心肺疾病\"是以下哪项的定义:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"哮喘","correct":false,"option_id":"c6a343c1-bbf1-4354-90d2-960ab5d523ef"},{"type":"text","content":"支气管扩张","correct":false,"option_id":"741c148b-ea9b-420e-9cd5-bd7fa320c065"},{"type":"text","content":"慢性支气管炎","correct":true,"option_id":"fee8e949-2c7e-41a9-9606-8e6529df8c88"},{"type":"text","content":"肺结核","correct":false,"option_id":"22624ad2-b408-47e8-acea-c49fcab3966d"},{"type":"text","content":"弥漫性泛细支气管炎","correct":false,"option_id":"863b17a7-6e05-47f0-8b80-ee57bd97b973"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"连续两年、每年至少三个月的咳嗽咳痰, 排除其他原因后符合慢性支气管炎的传统临床定义。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/c5323dac-b08d-4d28-af24-cf851861196f/060e1917de2a63e0bd39b0cdd5ba13bfdaa9d278ed494440ba489b490dcddecb.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"c5323dac-b08d-4d28-af24-cf851861196f","revision":"sha256:060e1917de2a63e0bd39b0cdd5ba13bfdaa9d278ed494440ba489b490dcddecb","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"诊断 COPD 的必要条件和\"金标准\"检查是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"胸部 X 线片","correct":false,"option_id":"c634db60-c739-4eea-933f-fcdda5294845"},{"type":"text","content":"血气分析","correct":false,"option_id":"fc200b6c-8b0b-48d3-a819-569d420f2e0e"},{"type":"text","content":"支气管舒张剂后肺量计测定(FEV₁/FVC<0.70)","correct":true,"option_id":"7744b31a-5973-427b-a5c1-dd1c89346bd0"},{"type":"text","content":"峰流速仪测定","correct":false,"option_id":"fceacd37-1433-4f3c-ba91-7b465dfa8b76"},{"type":"text","content":"胸部 CT","correct":false,"option_id":"8319224c-0e1d-4528-8d97-92ce6e820cf4"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"本题采用GOLD固定比值标准: 支气管舒张剂后FEV₁/FVC<0.70是确认持续气流受限的肺量计指标, 还须结合症状、暴露和临床评估。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/fcb6071c-2e83-41d4-8396-30aff11de140/b8947b43117c86e390f4f8e437d24832bb6d35ccb2e66d9f35cb8b3262ae1c2b.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"fcb6071c-2e83-41d4-8396-30aff11de140","revision":"sha256:b8947b43117c86e390f4f8e437d24832bb6d35ccb2e66d9f35cb8b3262ae1c2b","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"患者男, 55岁, 吸烟30年, 慢性咳嗽咳痰, 冬重夏轻. 以下病史中最不支持哮喘诊断的是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"幼年起病, 发作性喘息","correct":false,"option_id":"e5d03c88-bfb5-4d50-9900-656b8cba5bd9"},{"type":"text","content":"症状夜间及凌晨加重, 可自行缓解","correct":false,"option_id":"132a0733-20ca-46b2-82bd-4d916a7a0ed6"},{"type":"text","content":"有枯草热和湿疹史","correct":false,"option_id":"9dc10180-1c76-46ba-8d0f-543317a69159"},{"type":"text","content":"50岁起病, 症状缓慢隐匿进行性加重","correct":true,"option_id":"5680c838-a36b-4953-a09e-88e18712bc41"},{"type":"text","content":"母亲有哮喘病史","correct":false,"option_id":"9684391f-9a41-428c-8132-32098aa85abb"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"中年以后隐匿起病并逐渐加重更符合COPD的常见病程, 相比发作性、夜间波动和过敏史, 对哮喘的支持较弱; 单凭病史不能确诊。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/97a8613a-5725-4574-a37b-27ac7e79386e/975584bc2dfa0b514b291ea3baee33d6d913bd9e0dcbde4519c016461faa6471.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"97a8613a-5725-4574-a37b-27ac7e79386e","revision":"sha256:975584bc2dfa0b514b291ea3baee33d6d913bd9e0dcbde4519c016461faa6471","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"关于 COPD 稳定期支气管扩张剂的核心原则, 错误的是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"是缓解症状的基石, 按需或规律使用","correct":false,"option_id":"af7954ff-4ab9-4516-b2db-2c539ba01a52"},{"type":"text","content":"首选吸入途径","correct":false,"option_id":"79347c94-e44c-4f50-bbf0-1cb9bd2f2838"},{"type":"text","content":"长效制剂(LABA/LAMA)比短效制剂更方便, 更有效","correct":false,"option_id":"a66e4fd8-36a7-4bdd-a723-5d0bdeb352c3"},{"type":"text","content":"联合两种长效支气管扩张剂(LABA+LAMA)优于单药且不显著增加不良反应","correct":false,"option_id":"84611dce-6af6-4ab5-a28c-83aa7fb6515c"},{"type":"text","content":"应常规首选口服支气管扩张剂如茶碱","correct":true,"option_id":"b9b0c98b-02b7-4aca-bcbe-b04bab4d1725"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"吸入支气管扩张剂是稳定期缓解症状的重要治疗, 不应常规将口服茶碱作为首选。联合或单药应根据症状、加重史及个体反应选择。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/ae61f6bd-d1aa-452e-a421-f1b5a3373e53/3af876315fa206b90eff66bb01a2161e848b9e96d7ea8dc04eab2d873b369368.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"ae61f6bd-d1aa-452e-a421-f1b5a3373e53","revision":"sha256:3af876315fa206b90eff66bb01a2161e848b9e96d7ea8dc04eab2d873b369368","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"目前唯一被证实能延缓 COPD 患者 FEV₁ 年下降速率的干预措施是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"吸入糖皮质激素","correct":false,"option_id":"e2f696fd-99af-469e-813a-cd5b150f0089"},{"type":"text","content":"戒烟","correct":false,"option_id":"c1a3c559-c801-4cdb-882a-c0e672695484"},{"type":"text","content":"长期家庭氧疗","correct":false,"option_id":"6581689b-ad4c-43c8-8ce6-2549fe58efff"},{"type":"text","content":"长期口服 N-乙酰半胱氨酸","correct":false,"option_id":"0be3ac72-892a-4597-bf13-5576e9c8a5c9"},{"type":"text","content":"肺减容手术","correct":false,"option_id":"870ad8e5-8ed1-4d66-812f-c995979215f8"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"戒烟是减缓吸烟者COPD肺功能下降的重要措施, B可能是命题意图。但“唯一”过于绝对: TORCH试验的事后分析及其他研究观察到吸入药物对FEV1下降速率的影响, 研究结论并不完全一致。本题保留不判分, 待课程组确认。"}],"answer_status":"unavailable","selection_mode":"single"}}}]}